ormalize every implementation, DOM-test, browser-story, UI-story, inventory, and review artifact to require the same final border color as the authoritative task requirement, specifically a visible black border if plan-description.md section 3.1 is authoritative.\",\n      \"summary\": \"The plan alternates between a black final border and a white final border.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"target_role\": \"reviewer-b\",\n  \"terminal\": true,\n  \"transcript_sha256\": \"337771968600a3c46b20bb4b9d94bf63425fae3dfa50769ccc4b8af46aaf1be9\"\n}\n{\n  \"binding\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"reviewer-b-session-binding.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"ed93296e831a47ab742b6db75e3a0831f772a2b253b51597bac4f4c4b4a3d29e\"\n  },\n  \"defective_plan\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"provenance/defective-plan-manifest.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"af277111893fe9d0aa381243351cf8abbc6ebace9f107a0226b0b393bd9e1a21\"\n  },\n  \"lifecycle_handoff\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"reviewer-lifecycle.jsonl\",\n    \"sha256\": \"247ee9d40d6fc7f254107fb4045e31d1724c1f2eb5ac03a0c16f3b0ede0c47f6\"\n  },\n  \"reviewer_approval\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"reviewers/20260811T205844Z-clean-current-seeded-fresh-current-B-1786482768027444165/plan/approval.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"e8a8f07eb972bd4bff1df4a9863c437bf21f9780a2c85aa6394d281b412db7f9\"\n  },\n  \"reviewer_capsule\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"reviewers/20260811T205844Z-clean-current-seeded-fresh-current-B-1786482768027444165/capsule-manifest.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"c80d7000e2c4d952829229035e4c87d21ed992a4cf2febd450b6e37b785df688\"\n  },\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.4.2-provenance\",\n  \"selection\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"reviewer-selection.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"fd26c2580dbcade039fb92c608c0206547f691f6ef7cf5523decfd7a841312df\"\n  },\n  \"source_plan\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"basic-test-proof-current-20260811T205844Z-clean-current-seeded-fresh-isolated-plan\",\n    \"sha256\": \"5f231f106a6363a5f7a15674a06d9bb9f3299d0aee812dbfa96e002c8fca0f2d\"\n  },\n  \"target_snapshot\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"provenance/target-snapshot-manifest.json\",\n    \"sha256\": \"af277111893fe9d0aa381243351cf8abbc6ebace9f107a0226b0b393bd9e1a21\"\n  },\n  \"transcript\": {\n    \"archive_path\": \"worker.jsonl\",\n    \"sha256\": \"337771968600a3c46b20bb4b9d94bf63425fae3dfa50769ccc4b8af46aaf1be9\"\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
