hout unplanned files or hidden shortcuts.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W01 markup button-chain.html '\\\"'document body button-chain subtree' N/A \\\\\\\"Create the initial body structure with exactly one visible initial button and no completion text at load.\\\\\\\" '—' 01-button-chain-html 01-step-initial-markup\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W02 style button-chain.html '\\\"'.chain-button' N/A \\\\\\\"Style generated chain buttons as visible block-level controls stacked below the previous button.\\\\\\\" W01 01-button-chain-html 02-step-button-layout-style\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W03 source button-chain.html '\\\"'appendNextButton()' N/A \\\\\\\"Implement the click handler so only the current last button appends exactly one new button below it.\\\\\\\" W01,W02 01-button-chain-html 03-step-append-handler\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W04 source button-chain.html '\\\"'finishDocument()' N/A \\\\\\\"Implement the fourth generated button completion path so activation clears the document and prints lowercase finished with a visible white border.\\\\\\\" W03 01-button-chain-html 04-step-finish-handler\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W05 test button-chain.test.js '\\\"'button-chain interaction test' N/A \\\\\\\"Add an automated DOM interaction test that clicks through the chain and asserts initial, append, fourth-generated clear, exact finished text, and visible white border behavior.\\\\\\\" W01,W02,W03,W04 02-proof-and-handoff 01-step-dom-test\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-work-unit.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" W06 verification N/A '\\\"'Browser story US-01' N/A \\\\\\\"Run the planned user-facing browser story by clicking the current last button until the fourth generated button is pressed and record pass/fail evidence.\\\\\\\" W01,W02,W03,W04,W05 02-proof-and-handoff 02-step-browser-story\\n\\\\\\\"\\\"'$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-coverage.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Initial document contains one button and no premature completion state\\\" W01 \\\"Markup unit owns the load-state contract.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-coverage.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Buttons append exactly one below the current last button\\\" W02,W03 \\\"Layout and append handler units together cover visual order and click behavior.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-coverage.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Fourth generated button clears the document and prints exact finished text with white border\\\" W04 \\\"Completion handler owns the destructive final state.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-coverage.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Future proof includes automated DOM assertions and real browser interaction\\\" W05,W06 \\\"Testing and UI story verification units cover non-browser and browser proof.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-ui-story.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" US-01 \\\"Keyboard/mouse user opening the local HTML file\\\" \\\"Open button-chain.html, click the current last button four times, always choosing the bottom-most visible button\\\" \\\"Mouse click on the visible current last button for each chain step\\\" \\\"After the fourth generated button is clicked, the page contains only lowercase finished with a visible white border\\\" W01,W02,W03,W04,W06\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/configure-ui-story-cache.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" US-01 \\\"Fresh local button-chain.html loaded in a browser with one visible initial button\\\" \\\"Click the bottom-most visible button; repeat until the fourth generated button has been activated\\\" \\\"Current last button / completion result\\\" \\\"A new lower button appears after each of the first four qualifying clicks, then only finished remains with a visible white border\\\" \\\"2 seconds per click/result transition\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\\\" --testing-requirement \\\"$plan_dir\\\" 01-button-chain-html yes \\\"The HTML behavior is user-visible and must be proven by downstream DOM and browser-story verification work units W05 and W06.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\\\" --testing-requirement \\\"$plan_dir\\\" 02-proof-and-handoff yes \\\"This goal owns the planned automated and browser proof work units W05 and W06.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\\\" 01-step-initial-markup \\\"Automated DOM test W05 must load button-chain.html and assert exactly one button exists before any click, no finished text is present, and the button is visible. Browser story W06 must confirm the same load state before clicking.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\\\" 02-step-button-layout-style \\\"Automated DOM test W05 must assert appended buttons are in document order below the previous button. Browser story W06 must visually confirm each new button appears below the last clicked control.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\\\" 03-step-append-handler \\\"Automated DOM test W05 must click only the current last button and assert each click appends exactly one button; clicking a non-last prior button must not append. Browser story W06 must use normal mouse clicks on the bottom-most button.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\\\" 04-step-finish-handler \\\"Automated DOM test W05 and Browser story W06 must activate the fourth generated button and assert the document is cleared before rendering exactly finished with a visible white border.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/02-proof-and-handoff\\\" 01-step-dom-test \\\"Run the future repository-appropriate DOM test command, record command, exit code, and assertions covering W01-W04; the test must fail if text is not exactly lowercase finished or the white border is absent.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/02-proof-and-handoff\\\" 02-step-browser-story \\\"Run US-01 through real browser input only: load the local HTML file, click the current last visible button through the fourth generated button, capture final visible result, and record pass/fail evidence in ui-story-runs/US-01.md.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-adversarial-review.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-plan-progress.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-progress.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\\\" 01-button-chain-html\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-progress.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir/02-proof-and-handoff\\\" 02-proof-and-handoff\\n'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_19\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc 'PLANNING_SKILL_DIR=/tmp/ai-skills-capsules/20260811T205844Z-clean-current-seeded-fresh/current/worker/planning\\nplan_dir=basic-test-proof-current-20260811T205844Z-clean-current-seeded-fresh-isolated-plan\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-plan.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Button chain HTML implementation plan\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-ui-validation.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" \\\"Planning-only future local file validation; no browser run in this proof\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/add-goal.sh\\\" \\\"$plan_dir\\\" 01-button-chain-html \\\"Define button-chain HTML behavior\\\" \\\"A future executor can create button-chain.html with the exact initial button, append-only last-button interaction, fourth-generated-button completion behavior, and visible bordered finished state.\\\"\\n\\\"$PLANNING_SKI